# Rule Index (governance)

> Đọc khi **sửa** rule / prompt inject / registry — **không** inject lúc job Approve hay sinh TC.  
> Spec: [`docs/SYSTEM_MASTER_DOCUMENTATION.md`](../../docs/SYSTEM_MASTER_DOCUMENTATION.md)

## Hai pha Unit (đừng gộp)

| Pha | Runtime SoT | Cursor pointer |
|-----|-------------|----------------|
| **Sinh TC** | `unit_tc_analysis_*.md` → `unit_tc_analysis_rules.py` + `tc_*unit*.md` + `base.py` | [`unit-tc-from-analysis.mdc`](unit-tc-from-analysis.mdc) |
| **Approve path/code** | IDE Repository Intelligence (`unitApproveResolve`) + `unitApproveRpc` decision v2 | [`code-aliases-unit-gen.mdc`](code-aliases-unit-gen.mdc) |

Gen **không** chọn SUT path. Approve **không** inject analysis fragments.

## Phân tầng SoT

| Lớp | Vị trí | Ghi chú |
|-----|--------|---------|
| **Registry** | `api/app/rules/` | `rule_registry.yaml` + loader |
| **Runtime inject** | `api/app/llm/*_rules.py`, fragments `*.md` | Job đọc đây |
| **Cursor pointer** | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Map + link — **không** copy full essay |
| **Docs** | `docs/SYSTEM_MASTER_DOCUMENTATION.md` | Spec tổng hợp |

**Không** duplicate essay trong `.mdc`. Đổi hành vi → fragment / `*_rules.py` / TS ranking → cập nhật `rule_registry.yaml` nếu cần.

## Chức năng → profile (selective)

| Chức năng | Profile / pointer | Tags / ghi chú |
|------------|-------------------|----------------|
| Phân tích enrich | `PROFILE-ANALYSIS-ENRICH` | fidelity, features, flows, validation, schema |
| Chat Knowledge | `PROFILE-ANALYSIS-CHAT` | knowledge-diff, chat |
| Sinh TC Unit | `PROFILE-TC-UNIT` (+ analysis prepend) | BR/VAL/ERROR/AC-BE only |
| Sinh TC E2E | `PROFILE-TC-E2E` | flows, path, auth, coverage |
| Sinh Unit code | `PROFILE-UNIT-CODEGEN` | uutgs |
| Sinh E2E code | `PROFILE-E2E-CODEGEN` | playwright, grounding |
| Approve Unit | `code-aliases-unit-gen.mdc` | IDE Repository Intelligence + immutable decision — docs: `docs/UNIT_APPROVE_SOURCE_GROUNDING.md` |

Selective: `AITEST_RULE_RETRIEVE_MODE=selective` (+ gate `…_TCGEN` / `…_E2E` / `…_ANALYSIS`).

