| Domain | Cursor rule | Runtime SoT |
|--------|-------------|-------------|
| Phân tích | [`requirement-analysis.mdc`](requirement-analysis.mdc) | `knowledge_builder.py`, `analysis_rules.py` |
| Sinh TC Unit | [`unit-tc-from-analysis.mdc`](unit-tc-from-analysis.mdc) | fragments + `unit_tc_analysis_rules.py`, `tc_generation_rules.py` |
| Sinh TC E2E | [`e2e-tc-from-analysis.mdc`](e2e-tc-from-analysis.mdc) | `e2e_tc_analysis_rules.py` |
| Unit codegen | [`uutgs-unit-codegen.mdc`](uutgs-unit-codegen.mdc) | `uutgs_rules.py` |
| E2E codegen | [`e2e-codegen.mdc`](e2e-codegen.mdc) | `e2e_codegen_rules.py` |
| E2E grounding | [`e2e-grounding.mdc`](e2e-grounding.mdc) | `e2e_grounding_rules.py` |
| Approve Unit | [`code-aliases-unit-gen.mdc`](code-aliases-unit-gen.mdc) | `unitResolve/*`, `unitBodyRuleScore.ts` — xem `docs/UNIT_APPROVE_SOURCE_GROUNDING.md` |

## Checklist khi thêm/sửa rule LLM

1. `domain` + `tags` trong `rule_registry.yaml`.  
2. Đổi inject → `profiles.py`.  
3. Test (`test_unit_tc_analysis_rules`, `test_uutgs_rules`, …).  
4. `.mdc` chỉ cập nhật **link/map** — không paste full contract.
